cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Clinical-Assistant: a Virtual Clinical Team as a single Agent Skill"
message: "If you use this skill in research or clinical work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hernández Irisarri"
    given-names: "David"
    alias: makidav
repository-code: "https://github.com/makidav/clinical-assistant"
url: "https://makidav.github.io/clinical-assistant/"
abstract: >-
  An 8-phase clinical reasoning and medical evidence workflow for Claude,
  built to be verifiable rather than fluent. Runs differential diagnosis,
  GRADE evidence appraisal with validated instruments (AGREE II, QUADAS-2,
  RoB 2), a 13-perspective clinical board, and treatment planning. Every
  citation is resolved and checked for retraction; every diagnostic test is
  evaluated by post-test probability. Produces decision-support drafts for
  qualified clinicians — not diagnoses.
keywords:
  - clinical decision support
  - differential diagnosis
  - evidence-based medicine
  - GRADE
  - rare disease
  - medical AI
  - large language models
  - Claude Agent Skill
license: CC-BY-4.0
